  "absolute_rules": ["Do not fabricate data or APIs","Do not claim unexecuted tests/builds succeeded","Do not bypass security controls","Do not expose credentials","Do not silently overwrite verified student data","Do not let AI override deterministic eligibility","Do not let commission silently bias academic recommendations","Do not destroy existing OmniRoute functionality without inspection"]
